## 异常1: randwrite 180s × 3 轮导致池满
18:50 rand tests 开始 (randread/randwrite/randrw 各 180s × 3 轮)
19:17 randwrite-r2 失败 (rc=8), 池 100% full (170G stored, HEALTH_ERR)
  原因: randwrite 180s 产生 ~20G orphaned slices/轮, gc --delete 不工作(全部 skipped)
  128G layout + 3×20G randwrite + 3×20G randrw = 248G > 170G pool
  gc --delete skipped 全部 705K objects (0 valid, 0 leaked, 全部 skipped)
  → JuiceFS gc --delete 对 orphaned slices 不生效（可能是 v1.3.1 bug 或 rados 后端限制）

## 恢复
19:23 杀脚本, fusermount -uz, kill juicefs
19:29 删池重建 (ceph osd pool delete + create, pool ID 54→56)
19:30 reformat --force (误改 block-size 256→4096)
19:31 remount

## 异常2: block-size 误改
reformat --block-size 4096 误改 block-size 从 256→4096
发现: juicefs config 显示 BlockSize=4096, 原始应为 256
修正: reformat --force --block-size 256 → BlockSize=256 ✅

## 第三次尝试 (block-size 256, pool ID 57)
20:07 reformat --block-size 256 → 确认 BlockSize=256
20:08 remount A组
20:08 layout 128G (117 MB/s, 1175s) → 池 75.23%, 42G MAX AVAIL
20:29 cooldown (compact all OSDs)
20:30 rand tests 开始 (randread 180s, randwrite/randrw 60s 避免 pool 满)
  - randwrite/randrw 改为 60s (原 180s 产生过多 slices 导致 pool 满)
  - 60s: ~7G slices/轮 × 3 = 21G; randrw ~3.5G × 3 = 10.5G; total 31.5G
  - 128G + 31.5G = 159.5G < 170G pool → 安全

## fio 选项修正
- --read_bw_log 不存在于 fio 3.28, 改用 --write_bw_log (logs all bandwidth)
- --log_avg_msec=1000 存在且工作正常 (每秒一个数据点)
- bw_log 格式: time_ms, bandwidth_KBps, data_direction(0=read 1=write), 0, 0

